  "post_title": "Mercat Solidari de l'IES Serra d'Espadà amb l'ACCC d'Onda",
  "post_date": "2017-06-21 21:48:24",
  "post_name": "mercat-solidari-de-lies-serra-despada-amb-laccc-donda",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Educación|Noticias|Sociedad",
  "post_content": "<div>(36 fotos) L&#39;IES Serra d&#39;Espad&agrave; ha recaptat 550 euros per a l&#39;Associaci&oacute; Castell&oacute; Contra el C&agrave;ncer (ACCC) d&#39;Onda en una nova edici&oacute; del Mercat Solidari en el qual s&#39;ha implicat tota la comunitat educativa.</div>\n<div><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/06/IMG_1097.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>Ha sigut organitzat un any m&eacute;s per l&#39;alumnat de primer curs del Cicle Mitj&agrave; i primer curs de Formaci&oacute; Professiona B&agrave;sica (FPB) de la fam&iacute;lia Comer&ccedil; i M&agrave;rqueting, en col&middot;laboraci&oacute; amb les fam&iacute;lies de Manteniment i Cer&agrave;mica.</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/06/IMG_1130.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></div>\n<div>La finalitat d&#39;aquest projecte &eacute;s fomentar la participaci&oacute; de l&#39;alumnat en tasques solid&agrave;ries per tal de millorar el seu entorn i, a la vegada, posar en pr&agrave;ctica els coneixements adquirits al llarg del curs.</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div></div>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadetcanceries/img_1056.jpg\" alt=\"img_1056\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadetcanceries/img_1058.jpg\" alt=\"img_1058\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadetcanceries/img_1059.jpg\" alt=\"img_1059\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadetcanceries/img_1060.jpg\" alt=\"img_1060\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadetcanceries/img_1061.jpg\" alt=\"img_1061\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadetcanceries/img_1063.jpg\" alt=\"img_1063\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadetcanceries/img_1065.jpg\" alt=\"img_1065\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadetcanceries/img_1067.jpg\" alt=\"img_1067\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadetcanceries/img_1072.jpg\" alt=\"img_1072\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadetcanceries/img_1074.jpg\" alt=\"img_1074\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadetcanceries/img_1082.jpg\" alt=\"img_1082\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadetcanceries/img_1084.jpg\" alt=\"img_1084\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadetcanceries/img_1086.jpg\" alt=\"img_1086\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadetcanceries/img_1087.jpg\" alt=\"img_1087\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadetcanceries/img_1091.jpg\" alt=\"img_1091\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadetcanceries/img_1092.jpg\" alt=\"img_1092\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadetcanceries/img_1093.jpg\" alt=\"img_1093\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadetcanceries/img_1095.jpg